WEBVTT

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:08.990
7 Years Earlier

00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:10.500
The Place

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.430
TOKYO

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:14.530
He's a killer!

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:14.970
Wait!
He's a killer!

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:15.530
Wait!
Daddy...

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:16.670
Hey, someone call the cops!
Daddy...

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:21.770
Daddy!

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:33.890
Watch me...

00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:36.850
You just watch me, Daddy.

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:49.460
Time to die!

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:54.570
The perfect world!

00:00:54.570 --> 00:01:01.980
Tsukiakari no shita de yakusoku wo kawashita
We exchanged promises under the moonlight

00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:04.680
Let's break the spine!
Tsukiakari no shita de yakusoku wo kawashita
We exchanged promises under the moonlight

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:09.520
Tsukiakari no shita de yakusoku wo kawashita
We exchanged promises under the moonlight

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:13.860
Gozen reiji hoeru you ni sasayaite
At midnight, whispering like a roar

00:01:14.390 --> 00:01:19.090
Chinmoku to zattou no naka
In the silence and bustle of
your current situation

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:24.170
Kuruisou de kowaresou na genjou kai
Do you feel like you're gonna
go crazy and break?

00:01:24.970 --> 00:01:28.910
Kimi wa sou sa kimi no mama ikite
But live your own way, yeah, like you are

00:01:28.910 --> 00:01:32.310
That perfect world!
Kimi wa sou sa kimi no mama ikite
But live your own way, yeah, like you are

00:01:32.810 --> 00:01:38.020
Kamereon janakute
Let's not be chameleons

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:43.160
Kokoro kara kawarou
But change ourselves from the inside

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:46.860
Kikoeru yo sono kotoba
I can hear those words

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:53.400
Subete no yoru ga akeru you ni sakebou
Let's shout out so that the dawn
will break all nights

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:57.100
Hageshisa to yasashisa de
Gently and furiously

00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:08.670
Subete no yoru ga sakeru you ni sakebou
Let's shout out so that the dawn
will rip apart all nights

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:26.030
A little kid with a wooden sword?

00:02:26.030 --> 00:02:28.730
Kid or not, he sure knew how to use the thing!

00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:32.040
He's used it to send twenty or so
guys to the hospital.

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:34.940
What?! A wooden sword with a
red ornament tied to it?

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:38.010
Didn't that belong to that Kabukicho
samurai-for-hire guy?

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:40.530
I heard he got done in though.

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:45.810
I'm not gonna put up with assholes.

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:48.820
I'm not gonna put up with ya!

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:52.850
That so? Gotta be his brat then.

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:56.560
Does he mean to get revenge?

00:02:56.560 --> 00:02:59.970
Or does he think he's taking over for his dad?

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:02.530
Well, go play with him if you want.

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:04.900
He is just a brat after all.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:08.430
The Eleventh Night
Extra

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:11.780
Walk Onward, Children

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:30.620
Give up the tough guy act, kid.

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:37.870
Why, you little shit!

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:39.500
You fuckin' with us?!

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:56.660
Y..You little shit!

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:58.360
Doesn't know when to quit, does he?

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:00.930
Maybe we need to cut off two or three fingers?

00:04:00.930 --> 00:04:02.720
That's enough.

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:05.000
Who the hell are you?!

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:06.790
Get him!

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.800
Why, you!

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:19.370
Kyo..Kyouichi Houraiji!

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:22.240
Kamui...

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:24.710
Kyoshiro Kamui.

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:32.660
A monster?

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:33.990
Ow!

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:35.890
He's one rude, little brat.

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:38.700
So, you plan on taking care of a kid like this?

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:40.160
Yeah...

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:44.300
Whoa, cut it out! I'm against violence!

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:46.940
Gulp!
Club DIVA
What are you talking about?!
Your violent words are far more harmful!

00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:48.770
Gulp!
Club DIVA
How dare you insult me so?!

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:49.240
How dare you insult me so?!

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.480
That ain't what I meant!

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:52.810
I just said you look like monsters!

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:54.710
Ooh, he said it again!

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:56.510
Prepare to die!

00:05:01.890 --> 00:05:03.720
You!

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:05.690
C'mon, bros, let this one go, all right?

00:05:05.690 --> 00:05:08.160
Sayuri, Cameron...

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:09.930
Long time, no see, Master Kyo!

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:11.560
You've returned!

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:13.900
Oh, and don't call me "bro".

00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:15.300
Long time, no see?

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:16.670
It's only been three days.

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:19.170
Oh, but we missed you so much!

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:24.510
I'm Angelina, but my friends call me Angie.

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:27.350
I... I'm Kyouichi Houraiji.

00:05:27.350 --> 00:05:28.850
Kyochee, huh?

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:30.850
Oh, how cute!

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:32.650
Don't call me that!

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:36.120
Hey, Kyochee, I hear you're
looking for a place to stay.

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:38.520
You can stay here as long as you like then!

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:41.290
It's okay!

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:44.330
I'll tell Big Mama myself, Kyochee!

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:46.760
I told you not to call me "Kyochee".

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:55.610
Damn!

00:05:55.610 --> 00:05:57.400
Why, you!

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:00.250
Dammit...

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:01.850
Once more...

00:06:01.850 --> 00:06:03.640
Once more!

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:15.460
It seems that Kabukicho's samurai-for-hire
has been quite the busy fellow,

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:19.830
and certainly an object of adoration
to the boys at Club Diva.

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:21.900
What a big, strong man he's grown up to be.

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:23.700
I wonder...

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:28.140
Hey, no need to worry.

00:06:28.140 --> 00:06:31.580
He's someone you found worthy, right?

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:36.450
So, what's the big deal about the
Three Wise Men of Shinjuku?

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:39.580
You're no different than any of the other hoods.

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:42.680
You're just a bunch of swine.

00:06:56.570 --> 00:06:58.200
Damn!

00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:02.510
Once more...

00:07:02.510 --> 00:07:04.300
Once more!

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:18.790
Hey! What do you think you're doing?!

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:23.960
I'm Daigo, Yuuya Daigo, your boss's son!

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:27.300
If you got a problem, go tell my old man about it!

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:33.300
Huh? A gang?

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:34.940
That's right!

00:07:34.940 --> 00:07:38.210
It's a gang of boys about middle-school age.

00:07:38.210 --> 00:07:41.080
They start fights and set things on fire.
They even tore up a warehouse!

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:43.080
Someone called Magatsu

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:46.350
and a big guy named Daigo are
supposed to be the leaders.

00:07:46.350 --> 00:07:50.260
They say that Daigo boy is as strong as a bear!

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:52.050
How scary!

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:53.830
What are you going on about?

00:07:53.830 --> 00:07:54.960
I'm here, right?

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:56.980
So, that means I'll protect ya.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:00.500
I'm gonna roll up this Taiko or Maiko or whatever

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:03.170
and toss his ass into the sewage canal!

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:05.670
Behold, the Kabukicho samurai-for-hire!

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:07.340
We can always count on you, Kyochee!

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:08.870
I keep telling ya not to call me that!

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:11.740
Oh, how cute! He's blushing!

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:18.280
So, what's the matter, Kyochee?

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:20.580
Huh? Nothin'.

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:26.760
Do you even realize how that look in your eyes
has gotten worse and worse?

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:29.530
Could you just leave me alone?

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:31.600
Okay, whatever.

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:35.600
I'm just saying you might enjoy life more
if you lightened up.

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:37.440
Yeah, well thanks.

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:39.970
Don't you have any friends?

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:42.370
Of course I don't!
Makes me sick thinkin' about it.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.980
Kyochee, that gang we were
talking about is at it again!

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:48.780
They're right nearby!

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:51.380
Sounds like fun.

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:53.350
Magatsu!

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:55.510
Masaru! Takashi!

00:08:57.520 --> 00:08:59.420
I'm too late?

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:04.560
And here I was wondering why they
didn't put up much of a fight.

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:06.400
Are you Daigo?

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:08.730
Are you the Kabukicho samurai-for-hire?

00:09:10.340 --> 00:09:12.340
If you're the head of a bunch
of pussies like these,

00:09:12.340 --> 00:09:14.810
I guess you're not gonna be
much of a fight either.

00:09:14.810 --> 00:09:15.970
What?

00:09:15.970 --> 00:09:18.510
Oh, wow, now I'm scared!

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:21.550
Well, bad boy, you upset I kicked
the shit outta your buddies?

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:23.650
Don't make me laugh, you fuckin' pig!

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:27.240
You oughta reign in that wise-ass mouth of yours.

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:31.810
I'm gonna make you regret being born!

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:34.750
It's on!

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:37.120
It's on!

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:46.100
What's the matter? Huh?

00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:48.640
Come on!

00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:51.080
Oh, dear, stop him.

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:52.580
Stop Kyochee!

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:54.450
Angie, keep quiet.

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:54.780
But!

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:56.110
C'mon, wake up!
But!

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:58.010
You've gotta avenge your buddies!

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.080
Right?!

00:10:07.090 --> 00:10:09.660
Wh..What's that look supposed to mean?

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:11.630
You got some brass ones, don't ya?

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:18.170
Damn you, sonnuva! C'mon!

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:24.600
Just give it up and say you've lost already!

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:32.020
This is stupid.

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:33.720
I ain't got time for this!

00:10:33.720 --> 00:10:35.750
That's enough for today.

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:37.520
The next time I see your dirty face around here,

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:39.320
you won't get off so easy!

00:10:45.030 --> 00:10:46.200
Draw it.

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:47.500
Draw it?

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:50.000
But this is a real sword.

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:51.440
I don't get it.

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:53.500
You want me to come at you with this?

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.470
That's too much...

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:57.270
Going to run away again?

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:00.450
When did I ever run away?!

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:02.150
Who did I run away from?!

00:11:02.150 --> 00:11:03.820
Huh?

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:05.250
Are you scared?

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:06.880
What?

00:11:10.090 --> 00:11:11.590
Why you...

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:13.220
Make an ass outta me, huh?

00:11:13.220 --> 00:11:14.790
So, you're sure about this?

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:16.950
Whatever happens ain't my fault!

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:27.470
Ouch...

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:29.140
Yeah, as if!

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:33.270
I couldn't hurt you like that,
so I went a little easy.

00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:37.080
You're mouth's improved,
even if nothing else has.

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:40.250
I get it.

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:43.580
If that's how you feel, then here I come for real!

00:11:56.600 --> 00:11:58.700
Damn it, damn it!

00:11:58.700 --> 00:12:01.140
Why? Tell me why!

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:07.450
Where is your sword pointed at?

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:09.410
Your past?

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:11.280
Revenge for your father?

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:19.650
The one who's taken the edge off
that sword is you, yourself.

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:24.360
Sakuragaoka Central Hospital

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:26.400
Sakuragaoka Central Hospital
He's gone?

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:27.890
Sakuragaoka Central Hospital
I see...

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:31.540
He drifted into this town, you see.

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:33.730
Who knows where he came from.

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:37.470
No worries; the man's like a cloud.

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:41.180
When the wind blows again, I'm sure he'll...

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:47.220
We'll be able to live together soon, Mother.

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:49.120
I've got a promise with him.

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:51.990
If I got accepted to that high school,

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:54.480
then he said he'd let you out of here.

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:56.730
And you know what else?

00:12:56.730 --> 00:13:00.460
You must not let yourself be deceived, Manabu.

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:06.030
There is no chance that the people
of this house will forgive us.

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.240
Listen well...

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:12.870
You have a true name,
one that carries with it great pride.

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:15.880
True name?

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:19.980
Oh, it's a plane.

00:13:22.390 --> 00:13:25.020
Wonder if it's flying from Tokyo?

00:13:27.690 --> 00:13:29.530
Tokyo, huh?

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:31.320
That's pretty far away...

00:13:33.630 --> 00:13:36.300
What? Really, Mother?

00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:39.140
Yes, he just disappeared all of a sudden.

00:13:39.140 --> 00:13:41.440
Hisui has supposedly taken over the shop.

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:46.210
Kisaragi...

00:13:46.210 --> 00:13:49.440
I heard about your grandfather.

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.850
I'm worried about him.

00:13:58.160 --> 00:14:01.290
Oh, I got some delicious fruit.

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:02.960
I'll go get it ready now.

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:04.000
You needn't trouble yourself.

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:05.790
Wait right there!

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:11.130
Lady Aoi...

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:17.010
He said to give this to you.

00:14:17.010 --> 00:14:18.010
What?

00:14:18.010 --> 00:14:20.040
We don't have any idea either.

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:25.000
But he did ask us to take care of you
and stay with you.

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:27.720
What the hell is this?!

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:29.050
Dunno...

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:30.890
But listen, Kyochee.

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:33.860
Don't you be discouraged. Hang in there.

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:45.600
Oh, yeah! Perfect, just perfect!

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:48.910
"lf I ever lost the ability to draw my bow,
I'd just die", right?

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:52.210
Uh, what was that girl's name?

00:14:54.150 --> 00:14:54.410
Someone call for an ambulance!

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:57.320
Ah, well, whatever!
Someone call for an ambulance!

00:14:57.320 --> 00:14:59.910
Sakuya! Sakuya!

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:10.490
You're, um, Sagaya, right?

00:15:11.530 --> 00:15:14.330
You came to the Student Council once,
didn't you?

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:15.770
Oh, yeah.

00:15:15.770 --> 00:15:17.400
You're Misato, right?

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:18.640
Yeah!

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:19.800
And who's he?

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:21.310
I just happened upon him.

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:22.870
He looked kind of lonely.

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:24.040
I just couldn't leave him.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:26.530
I really love puppies, you see.

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:32.540
Woo-hoo!

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:36.590
The latest, greatest digicam is finally mine!

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:39.390
The times...

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:42.420
The times have finally caught up with me!

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:47.290
Oh, just you wait for me now,
my precious scoops!

00:15:48.870 --> 00:15:50.670
Grandfather...

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:52.860
Where in the world have you gone?

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:56.840
Are you telling me to live on my own?

00:15:56.840 --> 00:15:59.330
When I'm not halfway through my training?

00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:02.940
All alone?

00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:24.040
Mother, I passed.

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:25.940
We could have lived together.

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:28.230
Why?

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:30.640
Why all this?

00:16:35.780 --> 00:16:38.320
Ma.. Manabu, you...

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:41.150
Wrong, wrong...

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:43.650
I am Kozunu...

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:46.750
Tendo Kozunu!

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:55.330
Magatsu, l... I...

00:17:03.170 --> 00:17:04.710
What's the big deal?

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:07.950
He's someone you found worthy, right?

00:17:07.950 --> 00:17:10.280
Sooner or later, he'll surely...

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:12.710
Please stop!

00:17:13.020 --> 00:17:14.950
I don't know what the circumstances might be,

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:16.220
but you're going overboard!

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:18.390
What?! Don't make me laugh!

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:21.030
This guy's a filthy swine who
turns kids into junkies.

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:22.330
That doesn't mean you...

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:25.930
Once he's got 'em hooked,
he moves on to new prey.

00:17:25.930 --> 00:17:27.370
His life has no value.

00:17:27.370 --> 00:17:29.960
It doesn't matter one damn bit if I kill him!

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:35.810
No matter what kind of person someone is,

00:17:35.810 --> 00:17:38.470
it doesn't mean their heart was
corrupted from the very start.

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:41.380
Things happen...

00:17:41.380 --> 00:17:44.950
Iots of painful, sad things,

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:47.280
and it crushes their hearts.

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:50.760
But no matter how corrupted they may become,

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:54.430
the hearts they were born with still
lie somewhere beneath.

00:17:54.430 --> 00:17:56.220
That is what I believe.

00:17:56.660 --> 00:17:58.830
Please don't let things like
"it wouldn't matter if I killed him"

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:00.730
come out of your mouth so easily!

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:01.930
Enough of this crap!

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:05.100
Like you... Like you could possibly understand!

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:07.140
C'mon, move it!

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:08.140
No!

00:18:08.140 --> 00:18:09.070
Hey!

00:18:09.070 --> 00:18:10.040
I won't move.
Hey!

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:10.910
Move it!

00:18:10.910 --> 00:18:12.040
I won't move!
Move it!

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:13.840
Why, you...

00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:17.970
She's...

00:18:34.430 --> 00:18:37.920
"Hearts they were born with?"

00:18:42.070 --> 00:18:44.410
Daigo? You...

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:51.850
Kyochee, do you remember the guy
named Magatsu from that gang?

00:18:51.850 --> 00:18:54.650
They say he killed his dad.

00:18:54.650 --> 00:19:00.690
I heard his dad was a raging alcoholic
and beat him terribly.

00:19:00.690 --> 00:19:03.130
Supposedly, that Daigo boy only has his father,

00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:05.490
and things just aren't going well between them.

00:19:06.860 --> 00:19:09.100
Birds of a feather, huh?

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:10.900
How sad.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:14.830
Hey, Daigo...

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:19.370
So, um...

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:14.400
And...

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:16.330
time passes by...

00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:18.330
Magami Academy

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:25.140
Who are you?

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:28.810
Yuu..Yuuya Daigo...

00:20:29.350 --> 00:20:32.820
Oh, okay, so you're Daigo, huh?

00:20:32.820 --> 00:20:34.690
I'm Komaki Sakurai.

00:20:34.690 --> 00:20:35.920
Nice to meet you.

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:37.720
Um, yes!

00:20:39.690 --> 00:20:41.320
Huh?

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:47.630
Is this some kinda joke?

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:49.860
Wow...

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:52.290
They look perfect together.

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:56.400
I sense a storm brewing!

00:20:58.640 --> 00:21:01.110
Done running?

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:04.100
We won't trouble anyone else here.

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:07.880
I don't like you at all.

00:21:12.560 --> 00:21:13.960
Sakurai?

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:15.360
You're going too?

00:21:15.360 --> 00:21:16.460
Yes!

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.260
I've got a bad feeling.

00:21:36.450 --> 00:21:38.350
Kyouichi Houraiji...

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:43.150
Tatsuma Hiyu...

00:21:46.290 --> 00:21:48.280
Wh..What was that all about?

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:54.260
There's my scoop!

00:21:55.400 --> 00:21:56.130
RAMEN

00:21:56.130 --> 00:21:57.270
RAMEN
Huh?

00:21:57.270 --> 00:22:01.400
RAMEN
Your sword was not pointed at me.

00:22:03.270 --> 00:22:07.240
It was as if someone was standing behind me,

00:22:07.240 --> 00:22:09.580
and your eyes were on them.

00:22:09.580 --> 00:22:11.570
It felt like that.

00:22:14.290 --> 00:22:17.310
Where is your sword pointed at?

00:22:18.260 --> 00:22:19.990
Revenge for your father?

00:22:19.990 --> 00:22:21.890
Your past?

00:22:22.560 --> 00:22:26.360
Hey, Big Mama, look at that sleeping face.

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:27.400
Yeah...

00:22:27.400 --> 00:22:31.140
He's as relaxed now as we'll probably
ever see him again.

00:22:31.140 --> 00:22:33.160
He's adorable!

00:22:33.900 --> 00:22:36.400
I'm tellin' ya, I can't eat another bite...

00:22:41.810 --> 00:22:46.920
I sadly hung my head a bit

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:51.620
And finally you murmured

00:22:52.020 --> 00:22:56.260
What I heard was a faint goodbye

00:22:56.260 --> 00:23:01.200
Said with all your might

00:23:03.130 --> 00:23:12.410
Our pulses echo in the awkward silence

00:23:12.410 --> 00:23:14.280
We can see each other again

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:16.780
Let's meet up again some time

00:23:16.780 --> 00:23:22.590
Let's each set out in search of our own futures

00:23:22.590 --> 00:23:27.090
For the kindness you gave me for my heartache

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:31.530
I thank you now

00:23:32.700 --> 00:23:37.330
These flower petals seem just as if

00:23:37.330 --> 00:23:38.770
They were blessing us

00:23:38.770 --> 00:23:42.970
As we depart on our journeys

00:23:42.970 --> 00:23:47.340
I won't forget your warmth

00:23:47.340 --> 00:23:51.800
That overwhelmed my loneliness

00:23:52.620 --> 00:23:57.710
I thank you now

00:24:06.500 --> 00:24:07.430
Next Episode

00:24:07.430 --> 00:24:10.270
ROMEO & JULIET

00:24:10.270 --> 00:24:12.700
ROMEO & JULIET
The Twelfth Night
Extra
Thank You
